type: bullet-list
title: Engineering Principles

- Design for testability first: Write code easy to verify in isolation
  - Isolate side effects
  - Prefer pure functions
- Minimal scope per change: One concern per commit
- Read before editing
  - Skim the call sites
  - Check for side effects
- Cache hot reads (e.g.: redis): cuts p99 by ~40%
- Standup at 9:30am sharp
- Verify your work: Run lint, tests, review diff
- Note\: this list is not exhaustive
- Update docs alongside code
